{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>I will go down with you to Egypt, and I will also bring you up.</b> When they went down to Egypt, the Holy One, blessed be He, was counted with them in person and in His glory — for when you count them individually you find only sixty-nine, yet it is written ״בשבעים נפש״ etc. Thus the Holy One, blessed be He, was counted with them and they were seventy. And also when they went up, they went up sixty myriads minus one, and the Holy One, blessed be He, was counted with them and went up, and they were whole. Another explanation: ״and I will also bring you up״ — do not imagine that you will be inferior there; rather, there you will be great and exalted."], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 46, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:07:09.034023936Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}